name 'iterating-with-ai-preassessment-q11_2025'

question 'Why is a "Reset" or "Undo" button important in a data-driven dashboard?'

right 'It allows the user to recover the original dataset after applying filters or making edits.'
wrong 'It is the only way to close the web application.'
wrong 'It automatically sends a report of all user actions to the developer.'
wrong 'It changes the schema of the data to make it simpler.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 8

Providing a way to restore the original state (copy-not-mutate strategy) gives the user more control and confidence when exploring or editing data.
MARKDOWN
